        /// Replace the listed fields from one reviewed image, keeping every other bit (`RF_PWC`).
        ///
        /// SOURCE: C5_BLOB_LIBPHY_RF_INIT_LEAVES, ESP_IDF_4D59230D_C5_PMU.
