                /// Configure clock mode.\\ 0: Support SPI clock mode 0 or 2. See Table <a href="table:clock_pol_slave">link</a>.\\ 1: Support SPI clock mode 1 or 3. See Table <a href="table:clock_pol_slave">link</a>.\\
